@startuml
' Source of truth for: assets/diagrams/learning/data-plane/ngfw/packet-journey.svg
' Re-render with: plantuml -tsvg packet-journey.puml
title One Packet's Journey — inspected flow going out over VPN

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left

start
:0. Ingress — inbound VLAN sub-interface\npacket arrives; 5-tuple (src:port -> dst:port, proto);
:1. ip4-input\nparse + validate header, checksum, TTL;
:2. acl-plugin\nrule match -> steering tag = SNORT_NAT_IPSEC\n[opaque2[0..3] = tag];
:3. ngfw-decision\naction = snort-then-nat-then-ipsec; continue arc\n[note = { cookie 0xAB, post=NAT, sa=# }];
:4. snort-ip4-input\ndeep inspection -> verdict PASS (a DROP never returns);
:5. ngfw-post-snort\ncookie 0xAB valid -> post_action = NAT\n[read note -> NAT; cookie consumed];
:6. nat44\ntranslate source addr/port; open a session (flow state);
:7. esp4-encrypt\nencrypt with the outbound IPsec SA\n[buffer.ipsec.sad_index = SA];
:8. Egress — VPN-out VLAN sub-interface\nencrypted packet leaves toward the tunnel peer;
stop

note right
Drop paths (not shown):
- policy DROP -> error-drop at step 3
- Snort DROP verdict -> error-drop
  (never reaches step 5)
end note
@enduml
